  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder with concat fusion in a singleprofile setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5362 and F1 of 0.5158. This performance is lower than previous multimodal baselines, suggesting potential limitations in the image encoder choice or singleprofile configuration. The relative impact of the RNA encoder versus image encoder remains uncertain without direct comparison to configurations using imagenet_vit_l or alternative profile settings."
